# Using Number Functions with Table Data

Round Salary

```sql
SELECT Name,
       ROUND(Salary,0) AS RoundedSalary
FROM Employee;
```

---

Calculate Square Root

```sql
SELECT SQRT(81);
```

---

Calculate Power

```sql
SELECT POWER(10,3);
```

---

Find Remainder

```sql
SELECT MOD(17,5);
```

---

Generate Random Number

```sql
SELECT RAND();
```

