## Difference between ROUND() and TRUNCATE()

| ROUND() | TRUNCATE() |
|-----------|------------|
| Rounds value | Removes decimals |
| May increase value | Never rounds |

Example

```sql
ROUND(25.678,2)      → 25.68
TRUNCATE(25.678,2)   → 25.67
```

---

## Difference between CEIL() and FLOOR()

| CEIL() | FLOOR() |
|----------|-----------|
| Rounds Up | Rounds Down |

Example

```sql
CEIL(15.2)  → 16
FLOOR(15.9) → 15
```

